    "Change-Boot": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Change-Boot"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Change-Boot"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Change-Boot has to restart to load the other language.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Change-Boot has to restart to load the other language."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Change-Boot musi się uruchomić ponownie, żeby wczytać drugi język."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Change-Boot speaks Polish and English. Pick the language in Options, in the Change-Boot menu at the top of the screen, or in the menu bar icon. The app restarts when you change it, because the language is loaded once, when the app starts.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Change-Boot speaks Polish and English. Pick the language in Options, in the Change-Boot menu at the top of the screen, or in the menu bar icon. The app restarts when you change it, because the language is loaded once, when the app starts."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Change-Boot mówi po polsku i po angielsku. Język wybierzesz w Opcjach, w menu Change-Boot na górze ekranu albo w ikonie w pasku menu. Zmiana uruchamia program ponownie, bo język wczytuje się raz, przy starcie."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Changing the startup disk needs administrator rights. Install the helper once and Change-Boot stops asking for your password on every switch.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Changing the startup disk needs administrator rights. Install the helper once and Change-Boot stops asking for your password on every switch."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zmiana dysku startowego wymaga uprawnień administratora. Zainstaluj pomocnika raz, a Change-Boot przestanie pytać o hasło przy każdym przełączeniu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clean start": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Clean start"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Czysty start"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clean start — do not reopen apps and windows": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Clean start — do not reopen apps and windows"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Czysty start — nie przywracaj programów ani okien"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Colour": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Colour"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kolor"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Colour: %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Colour: %@"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kolor: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connect the disk you want to boot from and press Rescan.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Connect the disk you want to boot from and press Rescan."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Podłącz dysk, z którego chcesz startować, i naciśnij „Szukaj ponownie”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Could not build the helper script.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Could not build the helper script."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nie udało się zbudować skryptu pomocniczego."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Could not determine the physical disk.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Could not determine the physical disk."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nie udało się ustalić dysku fizycznego."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Could not eject %@.\n\n%@%@\n\nDo NOT unplug the disk — it is still mounted.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Could not eject %@.\n\n%@%@\n\nDo NOT unplug the disk — it is still mounted."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nie udało się wysunąć %@.\n\n%@%@\n\nNIE WYPINAJ dysku — nadal jest zamontowany."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Could not set the startup disk.\n\n%@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Could not set the startup disk.\n\n%@"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nie udało się ustawić dysku startowego.\n\n%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Could not talk to the privileged helper.\n\n%@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Could not talk to the privileged helper.\n\n%@"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nie udało się porozumieć z pomocnikiem.\n\n%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Current": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Current"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bieżący"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Done": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Done"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gotowe"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each system gets its own colour so you can tell them apart at a glance. Click the disk icon in a row to change it. The colour is stored with the entry, so an unplugged disk keeps it, only dimmed.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each system gets its own colour so you can tell them apart at a glance. Click the disk icon in a row to change it. The colour is stored with the entry, so an unplugged disk keeps it, only dimmed."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Każdy system ma własny kolor, żeby dało się je rozróżnić jednym spojrzeniem. Kliknij ikonę dysku w wierszu, żeby go zmienić. Kolor siedzi w konfiguracji, więc odpięty dysk zachowuje swój — tylko przygaszony."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Eject": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eject"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Odepnij"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Eject the whole disk safely": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eject the whole disk safely"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bezpiecznie wysuń cały dysk"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ejects the whole physical disk, not just the volume you see in Finder. Finder leaves the hidden data volume mounted, which is why unplugging after a Finder eject makes macOS complain that the disk was not ejected properly.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ejects the whole physical disk, not just the volume you see in Finder. Finder leaves the hidden data volume mounted, which is why unplugging after a Finder eject makes macOS complain that the disk was not ejected properly."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wysuwa cały dysk fizyczny, nie tylko wolumin widoczny w Finderze. Finder zostawia zamontowany ukryty wolumin danych i dlatego po jego wysunięciu macOS zgłasza, że dysk nie został wysunięty poprawnie."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every macOS installation found right now is already on the list. Connect another disk and it will show up here.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Every macOS installation found right now is already on the list. Connect another disk and it will show up here."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Każda znaleziona teraz instalacja macOS jest już na liście. Podłącz kolejny dysk, a pojawi się tutaj."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every macOS installation you added sits here, remembered by the volume's UUID — not by its name. Rename the disk and the entry follows. Unplug it and the entry stays, greyed out, because an unplugged disk is no reason to forget your settings.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Every macOS installation you added sits here, remembered by the volume's UUID — not by its name. Rename the disk and the entry follows. Unplug it and the entry stays, greyed out, because an unplugged disk is no reason to forget your settings."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Każda dodana instalacja macOS siedzi tutaj, zapamiętana przez UUID woluminu, a nie przez nazwę. Zmienisz nazwę dysku — wpis nadąży. Odepniesz dysk — wpis zostanie, tylko przygaszony, bo odpięty dysk to nie powód, żeby zapomnieć ustawienia."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every setting lives in the Options window — the gear button at the bottom of the main window, or Command-comma. That is also where you install the helper that stops macOS asking for your password on every switch.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Every setting lives in the Options window — the gear button at the bottom of the main window, or Command-comma. That is also where you install the helper that stops macOS asking for your password on every switch."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wszystkie ustawienia siedzą w oknie Opcji — przycisk z kołem zębatym na dole okna głównego albo Command-przecinek. Stamtąd instaluje się też pomocnika, dzięki któremu macOS przestaje pytać o hasło przy każdym przełączeniu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
