    "Sets the startup disk, checks that the firmware really accepted it, and only then restarts. If the check fails, nothing restarts — the Mac would have booted the wrong system.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sets the startup disk, checks that the firmware really accepted it, and only then restarts. If the check fails, nothing restarts — the Mac would have booted the wrong system."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ustawia dysk startowy, sprawdza, czy firmware naprawdę go przyjął, i dopiero potem restartuje. Gdy sprawdzenie wypadnie źle, restartu nie ma — Mac wystartowałby z niewłaściwego systemu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
